+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns the merged document without changing either input. Object patches recursively merge
+members, `null` removes an object member, and arrays or other non-object patches replace the target.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+applyMergePatch({ name: "Ada", settings: { theme: "light" } }, { settings: { theme: "dark" } });
+// { name: "Ada", settings: { theme: "dark" } }
+```
